592186434276 1077 "field-1" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434276 1078 #edb/ref 17592186434268 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434276 1079 #uuid "878be2a7-5abd-5dc4-9fe0-30ce370e3435" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434277 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434274 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434277 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434275 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434277 1069 "q-279199" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434277 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434277 1071 "For the ellipse $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{13}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{36}=1,$ find the lengths of its major and minor axes.\n\n$\\,$ The length of the major axis is \n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ The length of the minor axis is \n{{field-2}}." 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434277 1072 #uuid "3c46acbe-8af8-5805-a582-9ade9300c9a5" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434277 1074 "Remember that the equation of an ellipse centered at the origin with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the given equation, we have ${a}^{2}=13$ and ${b}^{2}=36.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=13,$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{13}.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=36,$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{36}=6.$\n\nThus, the semi-major axis has length $b=6,$ and the semi-minor axis has length $a=\\sqrt{13}.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2b=2\\cdot 6=12,$ and the minor axis has length $2a=2\\cdot \\sqrt{13}=2\\sqrt{13}.$" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434278 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434273 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434278 1069 "q-16458" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434278 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434278 1071 "![](images/2a/2adb84964a605495c84921943ec76f9820ba18851cda817037dd6022808d1fd7.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the ellipse given above?" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434278 1072 #uuid "5fbef9b7-68b9-5b6d-beff-b38a63574b1c" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434278 1074 "Remember that the equation of an ellipse centered at the origin with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nHere, the horizontal radius has length $a=2$ and the vertical radius has length $b=3.$ Therefore, the equation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{{2}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{3}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434279 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434272 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434279 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434276 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434279 1069 "q-279167" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434279 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434279 1071 "For the ellipse $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{49}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{25}=1,$ find the lengths of its major and minor axes.\n\n$\\,$ The length of the major axis is \n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ The length of the minor axis is \n{{field-2}}." 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434279 1072 #uuid "cb8398f9-e97a-58eb-bd8b-b49ccd2d689d" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434279 1074 "Remember that the equation of an ellipse centered at the origin with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the given equation, we have ${a}^{2}=49$ and ${b}^{2}=25.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=49,$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{49}=7.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=25,$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{25}=5.$\n\nThus, the semi-major axis has length $a=7,$ and the semi-minor axis has length $b=5.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2a=2\\cdot 7=14,$ and the minor axis has length $2b=2\\cdot 5=10.$" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434280 1062 #uuid "54f488a2-5ee1-5f4b-9b2d-7bfa683c828f" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434280 1063 #edb/ref 17592186434277 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434281 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434282 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434281 1062 #uuid "5892bfa8-ea88-5074-97ec-8c9cbbf249ae" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434281 1063 #edb/ref 17592186342039 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434282 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434280 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434282 1062 #uuid "79a4f735-1f4e-5bcc-bb32-263a73f8784e" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434282 1063 #edb/ref 17592186434279 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434283 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434281 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434283 1062 #uuid "b18ed940-7683-5b5f-9c24-6ca0a2adfa96" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434283 1063 #edb/ref 17592186434278 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434284 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434283 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434284 1062 #uuid "e66467af-9a14-51f4-92e2-3d41e87b4f10" 13194139534727 17592186045417 true] [17592186434284 1063 #edb/ref 17592186284499 13194139534727 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-2d86a4f4-b8ba-5875-b01b-334ee3c8800c" 17592186434262 "answer-1dcd62ed-d1d5-5d66-b9a7-d3752b72ffcb" 17592186434263 "answer-224b79cf-bf9d-546e-92e5-652da96853b2" 17592186434264 "answer-239820f5-492c-5074-bb16-a6af5ed54f89" 17592186434265 "answer-2cb3f03d-cfef-5f9f-b396-26b221d4f856" 17592186434266 "answer-53b5a01d-de71-5112-abcb-3f57176855d3" 17592186434267 "answer-56513915-f193-5d63-936d-07a8b133ceae" 17592186434268 "answer-64c8fe0e-8e01-5ebd-869d-3e05d36b78cb" 17592186434269 "answer-9428f7fa-4636-5ad9-ac5c-92